{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eaae8c072e3f5720abe289300ae58d10193e4c8b6476168a783fbcc295b6b482", "ja": "（今日は風花のCM撮影。大人っぽくワインを\n紹介する姿は、スポンサーさんにも好評だった！）", "zh": "（今天是风花的广告拍摄工作。\n她用成熟的举止介绍红酒的模样，获得赞助商的好评！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "72b32f21760c797a1ff8f71f32015b8e93a05ef4824e0747d605221ad7c4e3df", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nあの……今日の私、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n那个……我今天表现得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1a4abb5cb09599e23fbfad2136446ffdcdb3a46a0cee7cb99bc85f4c8d18112c", "ja": "ああ、スタッフさんもみんな褒めてたよ。\nワインを飲む仕草に、大人の魅力が溢れてるって。", "zh": "很棒啊，工作人员和大家都在夸奖你喔，\n说你喝红酒时，举手投足充满大人的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a8f45e6170afab490d932eaa2f58ea48398484c9f2d4a8ece65330ee3f8229fc", "ja": "そ、そうですか？　そんなふうに言われると\nちょっと照れちゃいますけど、うれしいな……♪", "zh": "是、是吗？大家这样说我会有点害羞，\n可是好开心喔……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5635a8805f0ba4b43f1ddac0b0dd1af315ed9b6f78c670bb53b3a47102c81165", "ja": "風花にお願いして良かったよ。あ、そうそう。\n余ったワインは持って帰っても構わないそうだ。", "zh": "当初拜托你真是找对人了。啊，对了对了，\n他们说可以把剩下的红酒带回去喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d2ff38ecd8ec84734938ff12c3a35913c6f532800158fcfd012d0b3111a085d9", "ja": "わぁ、本当ですか？　じゃあ、お仕事をがんばった\nご褒美だと思って、いただいちゃいますね♪", "zh": "哇，真的吗？\n那我就当作是努力工作的奖励收下啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7d1f8d409c3fed7222397cdd1e7580449aaaf8f1c2c9e6796732415e6e40ed7f", "ja": "グラスに残ってる分は……\nせっかくだから、飲んじゃいましょうか？", "zh": "杯子里剩余的分……\n不喝可惜，就喝干了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "49b57168d11920e4942aedaf832845a01ef342c1fa7a1d7292c92196578fb667", "ja": "だからぁ～わらしはもっと……って、もぉ～！\n聞いてましゅか、{$P$}しゃん！", "zh": "窝就说了嘛～窝还可以再……哎唷～！\n泥有在听吗？{$P$}先森！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1008_p", "source_sha256": "533753adc95902b35796edaaa141bd19b2b2ca66d167f1bec8001ce2dd5b3921", "ja": "（よ、酔うのが早い……！\nグラス一杯分しか飲んでないのに……）", "zh": "（好、好快就喝醉了……！\n明明只喝了一杯的量……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1009_p", "source_sha256": "530895327341ca7f876b66cdec41aa7cfcb3be2f198006f6a8ee8897cb532a3a", "ja": "風花、少し水を飲んだほうがいいな。\n今持ってくるから……。", "zh": "风花，喝点水比较好，\n我这就去拿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "897fae2932c0bfc6d7b4abd0d66990bd2608697a71a08bb0bc1f71aae13cfa86", "ja": "あ～、行っちゃらめれす～！\nいいから背筋を伸ばして聞いてくだしゃい！", "zh": "啊～噗科以走掉～！\n好了，请泥立正站好听窝说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d1eaac27a36e9e4e94763c48cdce0675a77bdef1508373058d3d6d757db3c837", "ja": "（か、絡み酒だ……！）", "zh": "（喝、喝醉就会说教的类型……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "57d44ecbb68333e9145f5b85751331cccebc05c8cc6d6bd4be13b01b3eda0bd2", "ja": "まったくぅ、{$P$}しゃんは\nいっつも、しぇくしーなグラビア撮影ばっかりでぇ！", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先森\n总是让窝接性感写真照的拍摄工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ddcfe40eaa405f9be4b1026c876318f0e3c00f0cb41ecae589a7f55f22d1c14d", "ja": "わらしは正統派アイドルが良いって、何度も\n言ってるれしょぉ……恥ずかしいんれすからねぇ！", "zh": "窝噗是说过豪几次，窝想当正统派偶像吗……\n真的痕害羞耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9241bc876d1cc479a2197017f99b49b52a44cd60475156c6babef0a935a80945", "ja": "そ、そうだよな。すまない……努力はしてるんだけど、\nどうしてもそっち方面のオファーが多くて……。", "zh": "是、是啊，抱歉……我有在努力了，\n但那种类型的工作邀约总是比较多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4e78ef35cf273d02854447f7e081d377647d5350b03f83161cb455c3ca997a5a", "ja": "けど今日の撮影も、風花に似合うと思ったから\n提案したんだ。正統派とは違うかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "不过今天的拍摄工作，我是因为觉得你很适合，\n才主动提案的，虽然它可能不算正统派……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3c4afd43ba2470753dc7fba04e1dabd8b50f88f6f898e7e042897a68f3e80734", "ja": "ホントぉれすかぁ？　んー……確かに今日の撮影は、\nとっても楽しかったれすけどぉ……。", "zh": "真的麻？嗯……\n今天的拍摄工作确实是痕开心啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5d92fcf948ca29aa1b7a531f8536b8ce4d6b3920cb34e770ab7b0f50f2ee087f", "ja": "ああ、今後もなるべく風花の希望に沿うよう努力する。\n完璧とは言えないけど、期待しててくれ！", "zh": "是啊，今后我也会尽量照你的期望去努力，\n虽然称不上完美，但你拭目以待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0f76cc8840c7e051681604e8082150938f8880750fc2718151921506aef7164d", "ja": "う～、わかりました。……{$P$}\nしゃんのこと……信じてますからねぇ～？　えへへ♪", "zh": "唔～窝明白了。……{$P$}先森，\n窝相信泥喔～！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1019_p", "source_sha256": "549c849140f3dc4c17c282fdeab20f942146f2d0af6100908a19d693285d57e6", "ja": "そ、そうしてもらえると助かるよ、風花。\nそれじゃ、そろそろ……。", "zh": "那、那就太好了，风花。\n那么差不多该……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "319e4ec9bfa83ff561f3cefe03acd8f584b8f12bf36814e9e5acd940f9c50406", "ja": "だめれすよ、{$P$}しゃん！\n今日は朝まで飲みますよぉ～！", "zh": "噗行啦，{$P$}先森！\n今天要喝到天亮喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "57f68070dd4a7f4f9de2ccdc11ef972cd51babf97536aa0304557ae8c410dea6", "ja": "スポンサーさんからもらったボトルワイン、\nまだありますからね！　一緒に飲みましょ～♪", "zh": "赞助商给的红酒还有很多瓶呢！\n一起喝吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f21adf342a9dba9559a9cf32a1d39a6b97c604568f9167ee5c05dde0cd4235ad", "ja": "いや、俺はいいから……ってまだ飲む気か？\n風花、ちょっと休憩を……おーい、風花……！？", "zh": "不，我就不喝了……你还要继续喝吗？\n风花，稍微休息一下……喂～风花……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0134_1023_p", "source_sha256": "325b2134dad21b2c809c4532fdf1051fdb387a69ae7dcb39fdd1156701e1bc33", "ja": "（結局、そのまま寝てしまった風花を家まで送ったが、\n翌朝はいつもどおりだった。意外と強い……のか？)", "zh": "（结果，我把直接睡着的风花送回家，\n隔天早上她却状态如常，莫非她其实……挺会喝的？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
